# What the sdist carries, beyond what setuptools_scm's file finder offers
# it. The finder offers every git-tracked file, which is the wrong default
# for anything tracked that is reference material rather than source.
#
# specifications/ holds the DMTF OVF standards the parser was written
# against. They stay in git, where someone working on the parser can find
# them, but nobody installing from source needs several megabytes of
# PDFs. docs/plans/ is the project's working history and is pruned for
# the same reason.
prune specifications
prune docs/plans
